{[#]} 1. Rh8# {The Kill Box Mate occurs when a queen and rook work together to
checkmate the enemy king in a box:Thekill box mateis a box-shaped checkmate.
The checkmate is delivered by a rook with the queen's assistance. The rook is
adjacent to the king, while the queen supports the rook, being separated from
it by one empty square on the same diagonal as the rook. This forms a 3 by 3
box shape, inside which the enemy king is trapped. The king could be anywhere
on the board, but must have no escape squares available to him due either to
being on the edge of the board or to being blocked off by friendly or enemy
pieces.} *

